# Never in an image (docs/securite-des-secrets.md): secrets and data.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.data
**/.data
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Rebuilt inside the image, or not needed there.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.expo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.claude
.vscode
.idea
docs
**/*.log
